@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ActivityFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10
skinparam wrapWidth 200
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam ranksep 14

start
:Take an image (camera: in development)
and the scale range and optional
centre from SolveHints;
:StarDetector.detect: 5-sigma blobs
on a grid background, flux-weighted
centroids, elongation;
if (Saturated or bright sky, trailed\nstars, or fewer than 4 usable stars?) then (yes)
  #EDEDED:Failed: IMAGE_TOO_BRIGHT,\nSTARS_TRAILED or TOO_FEW_STARS;
  detach
endif
:Tile the search area (whole sky when
blind, else around the hint) and match
triangles of the 60 brightest detections
with catalogue triangles, mirror allowed;
:Per hypothesis: fit a similarity, refine
by least squares, refit on a deeper list;
if (At least 6 matches, spread over 1/4\nof the frame, scale in range, false-alarm\nprobability x hypotheses < 1e-6?) then (yes)
  #D8D8D8:Solved: centre RA/Dec, roll,\nscale, mirror;
  :Apply to alignment\n(in development);
  stop
else (no, or 25 s used up)
  #EDEDED:Failed: NO_MATCH;
  stop
endif
@enduml
